01:28:28,840 --> 01:28:30,380
And please turn that TV off.

1373
01:28:30,580 --> 01:28:30,960
Thank you.

1374
01:28:30,960 --> 01:28:32,500
Miss Yoshino, what happened?

1375
01:28:33,300 --> 01:28:34,620
They're investigating it.

1376
01:28:34,720 --> 01:28:35,160
Don't worry.

1377
01:28:35,580 --> 01:28:36,880
This is kind of exciting.

1378
01:28:38,000 --> 01:28:38,500
Oh?

1379
01:28:38,960 --> 01:28:40,960
Miss Yoshino, my dad was there.

1380
01:28:41,640 --> 01:28:42,920
Yes, I know you're worried,

1381
01:28:43,040 --> 01:28:45,100
but right now all we can do is wait here.

1382
01:28:45,840 --> 01:28:47,220
Please, you have to let me go!

1383
01:28:47,460 --> 01:28:47,720
Huh?

1384
01:28:47,840 --> 01:28:48,760
You can't leave the school.

1385
01:28:48,880 --> 01:28:49,420
It's dangerous.

1386
01:28:49,420 --> 01:28:51,020
I know it's hard,

1387
01:28:51,140 --> 01:28:53,600
but I'm sure he'll be back safe and sound, okay?

1388
01:28:55,300 --> 01:28:55,740
Hamamoto!

1389
01:28:55,740 --> 01:28:57,640
Let me go!

1390
01:28:57,640 --> 01:28:58,240
Get back to your seat.

1391
01:29:00,520 --> 01:29:01,840
Everyone, stay calm.

1392
01:29:02,180 --> 01:29:03,040
Everything will be fine.

1393
01:29:03,180 --> 01:29:04,140
Just be patient.

1394
01:29:04,140 --> 01:29:08,840
Hamamoto, are you okay?

1395
01:29:09,060 --> 01:29:09,700
What is it?

1396
01:29:09,740 --> 01:29:10,300
Let me help.

1397
01:29:10,960 --> 01:29:12,140
Didn't you hear the TV?

1398
01:29:12,360 --> 01:29:14,320
My father was swallowed up by the ocean.

1399
01:29:14,700 --> 01:29:14,960
Ugh.

1400
01:29:15,660 --> 01:29:19,960
I'm sure that he got too focused on his research, and...

1401
01:29:19,960 --> 01:29:21,260
The ocean is dangerous.

1402
01:29:22,000 --> 01:29:22,760
I know that.

1403
01:29:22,760 --> 01:29:26,680
Is my papa gonna die?

1404
01:29:27,480 --> 01:29:28,040
Ugh.

1405
01:29:28,040 --> 01:29:31,520
The penguin ship, it never came back, did it?

1406
01:29:31,980 --> 01:29:35,700
If only I'd told my papa that the ocean was dangerous.

1407
01:29:36,620 --> 01:29:38,660
But none of this would have ever happened.

1408
01:29:40,360 --> 01:29:41,380
I know it.

1409
01:29:44,380 --> 01:29:46,820
What do you think I should do, Aoyama?

1410
01:29:48,880 --> 01:29:50,080
I'm not too sure.

1411
01:29:50,620 --> 01:29:52,540
What I do know is what I have to do.

1412
01:29:53,260 --> 01:29:55,220
Aoyama, back to your seat, please.

1413
01:29:55,560 --> 01:29:56,600
I have to save him.

1414
01:29:56,980 --> 01:29:57,740
Please help me.

1415
01:29:58,040 --> 01:30:02,100
Excuse me.

1416
01:30:02,600 --> 01:30:03,880
Hamamoto's not feeling well.

1417
01:30:04,060 --> 01:30:05,880
I'd like permission to take her to the nurse.

1418
01:30:11,820 --> 01:30:13,300
We can't leave through the front.

1419
01:30:13,720 --> 01:30:14,120
All right.

1420
01:30:14,240 --> 01:30:15,400
So then, what should we do?

1421
01:30:16,560 --> 01:30:18,680
Hamamoto, you have to listen to me.

1422
01:30:19,180 --> 01:30:20,900
We're going to need the lady to help us

1423
01:30:20,900 --> 01:30:22,740
in order to save your father from the ocean.

1424
01:30:23,580 --> 01:30:25,720
Her penguins are the only thing we know

1425
01:30:25,720 --> 01:30:26,980
