1500
01:34:29,560 --> 01:34:30,240
Hold on.

1501
01:34:31,640 --> 01:34:34,020
You create the penguins, which repair it,

1502
01:34:34,020 --> 01:34:36,180
but you also create the Jabberwockies.

1503
01:34:37,280 --> 01:34:38,820
Jabberwockies eat the penguins,

1504
01:34:39,180 --> 01:34:42,460
