1511
01:34:56,740 --> 01:34:58,800
I'm the one who was wasting time.

1512
01:35:00,380 --> 01:35:01,940
How can I put it?

1513
01:35:03,680 --> 01:35:06,880
I guess I had a lingering attachment to this world.

1514
01:35:10,500 --> 01:35:13,340
Thanks for connecting the dots, young man.

1515
01:35:15,240 --> 01:35:17,620
Wow, it's gotten pretty big, huh?

1516
01:35:18,920 --> 01:35:22,040
I hope the research team is doing okay.

1517
